OL,3,GNEWSAWales' public services impacted by
OL,4,Aglobal Microsoft outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government is among a number
OL,7,Fof the country's public services that
OL,8,Fhave been impacted by the Microsoft
OL,9,Foutage.
OL,11,FSchools, GPs and businesses across the
OL,12,Fglobe have been hit with the outage
OL,13,Fwhich is affecting services including
OL,14,FTeams, Outlook and AI software Copilot.
OL,16,FA spokesperson for the Welsh government
OL,17,Fsaid: "We are monitoring the impact on
OL,18,Fgovernment services and using
OL,19,Fcontingency arrangements as needed."
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
