OL,3,GNEWSAWales' public services impacted by
OL,4,Aglobal Microsoft outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FMicrosoft said it was seeing
OL,7,F"encouraging recovery progress" in
OL,8,FEurope, but added "some users may still
OL,9,Fexperience intermittent issues". It
OL,10,Fconfirmed the issue was not caused by a
OL,11,Fcyber-security breach.
